      "Timestamp": "2026-08-05T15:02:05.031698-07:00",
      "Text": "[S] Keybinding taste is yours, not mine: I picked u/U for next-unresolved from mail-client convention (next-unread). If you would rather have n/N or ]c/[c, say so — zero design cost to change.",
