      "Line": 26,
      "SectionID": "s4",
      "SectionPath": "Review-First TUI Redesign \u003e Proposed Design",
      "Anchor": {
        "selected_text": "**Compose without leaving the flow (G3).** `c` opens a centered modal overlay (dimmed background) pre-filled with anchor context; `Ctrl+E` from any compose drops into `$EDITOR` for long text. `r` on an expanded thread replies in place — the compose box appears inside the sidebar thread, not a new screen. `R` toggles resolve on the focused thread."
